      "text": "the Holy Ghost fell upon Twelve Apostles, 1 Ne. 12:7. sword of abominable church shall fall upon own heads, 1 Ne. 22:13. those who fight against Zion shall fall into pit digged to ensnare the Lord’s people, 1 Ne. 22:14. angel had fallen from heaven, 2 Ne. 2:17 (Isa. 14:12; Luke 10:18; 2 Ne. 24:12). within 400 years sword of justice shall fall upon this people, Hel. 13:5 (3 Ne. 20:20). when Jesus had spoken these words, multitude fell to earth, 3 Ne. 11:12, 17. house built upon sand falls, 3 Ne. 14:24–27 (18:13; Matt. 7:24–27). the Holy Ghost falls upon Nephite disciples, 3 Ne. 19:13. brother of Jared2 fell down before the Lord, Ether 3:6. the Holy Ghost fell on those on whom disciples laid hands, Moro. 2:3.",
